    },
    "CardDescription": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_bath_soak",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_BathSoak_CardDescription",
        "DefaultText": "Dried chamomile and yarrow tied in twine. Drop it into a filled Copper Bathtub for a long, calming herbal bath, or into a pot of hot water to breathe its steam for a shorter calm."
    },
    "CardHelpSection": {
        "ParentObjectID": "herbs_fungi_bath_soak",
        "LocalizationKey": "Herbs_And_Fungi_BathSoak_CardHelpSection",
        "DefaultText": "<b>Made from:</b> 2 Dried Chamomile, 1 Dried Yarrow and 1 Twine, from the Medical tab.\n\n<b>Herbal Steam:</b> drag it onto hot water (at least half heat) in a cooking pot, cauldron or bowl. Soothing Soak rises by 48, which slows your Stress for about half a day.\n\n<b>Herbal Bath:</b> with Advanced Copper Tools, drag it onto a filled Copper Bathtub. Soothing Soak rises by 96, about a day of calm. Without that mod this action does not appear.\n\nThe bundle is used up either way. It does not wash you."
    },
